would welcome you with open arms?

67
00:07:29,072 --> 00:07:30,705
Don't you remember?

68
00:07:30,705 --> 00:07:35,305
Don't you remember when he left this house,
he only took Schweitzer?

69
00:07:38,005 --> 00:07:39,872
Yesterday, no...

70
00:07:39,872 --> 00:07:43,005
I went too far yesterday, no...

71
00:07:43,005 --> 00:07:46,205
I'm sorry about yesterday. But you also...

72
00:07:48,105 --> 00:07:49,938
I...

73
00:07:49,938 --> 00:07:54,072
Min... Min Seo. Min Seo? Min Seo!

74
00:07:59,472 --> 00:08:01,172
Min Seo!

75
00:08:01,172 --> 00:08:04,705
Are you sure you don't want a ride?

76
