87
00:09:23,005 --> 00:09:27,538
Oh dear... did I say
something I shouldn't have?

88
00:09:31,705 --> 00:09:34,538
- Here I go.
- Okay.

89
00:09:35,805 --> 00:09:37,805
I'm a true crew member

90
