Hello!

101
00:10:06,872 --> 00:10:07,938
Hi.

102
00:10:07,938 --> 00:10:11,272
Ji Su, this is the director
I told you about who lives next door.

103
00:10:11,272 --> 00:10:13,538
She's absolutely gorgeous.

104
00:10:14,838 --> 00:10:17,505
I've been working hard to promote you.

105
00:10:17,505 --> 00:10:19,205
Okay.

106
00:10:21,638 --> 00:10:23,372
[Honey]

107
00:10:25,772 --> 00:10:27,472
Yeah, honey.

108
00:10:27,472 --> 00:10:29,072
Yeah.

109
00:10:30,272 --> 00:10:32,038
Huh?

110
00:10:32,038 --> 00:10:33,805
Oh...

111
00:10:33,805 --> 00:10:35,305
Of course, yeah.

112
00:10:35,305 --> 00:10:36,672
Yeah, hold on, hold on.

113
00:10:36,672 --> 00:10:38,772
- Thank you for your hard work!
- Thank you.

114
00:10:38,772 --> 00:10:39,972
Yeah.

115
00:10:39,972 --> 00:10:43,038
Boo Jin, could you take care of
Ms. Ryu's post-treatment care?

116
00:10:43,038 --> 00:10:44,172
Sure.

117
00:10:44,172 --> 00:10:45,838
Well, Director.

118
00:10:45,838 --> 00:10:47,672
Huh?

119
00:10:47,672 --> 00:10:50,472
