our clinic is shutting down.

122
00:10:58,105 --> 00:11:02,305
He also said he's opening a new clinic
in the neighboring complex.

123
00:11:12,605 --> 00:11:15,672
[How to Use the Fire Hose Cabinet]

124
00:11:21,505 --> 00:11:23,338
What are you up to? Huh?

125
00:11:23,338 --> 00:11:26,705
Why are you spreading lies to our patients?

126
00:11:27,638 --> 00:11:30,005
<i>How about Kang Tae Han?
He's a box-office star. She'd be thrilled.</i>

127
00:11:30,005 --> 00:11:33,005
How am I supposed to bring him along?

128
00:11:33,005 --> 00:11:34,905
He probably has a dermatologist he goes to.

129
00:11:34,905 --> 00:11:36,505
<i>- Then this is the perfect chance to switch.</i>
- Huh?

130
00:11:36,505 --> 00:11:40,838
<i>Anyway, Hong, use any means necessary,
just bring him in no matter what.</i>

131
00:11:40,838 --> 00:11:43,572
Okay, fine. I'll talk to him first.

132
00:11:43,572 --> 00:11:44,905
<i>Yeah, make sure you do.</i>

133
00:11:44,905 --> 00:11:46,872
Okay.

134
00:11:46,872 --> 00:11:49,305
<i>You were the one who changed the passcode</i>

135
00:11:49,305 --> 00:11:51,438
<i>to the second house without telling me.</i>

136
00:11:51,438 --> 00:11:53,805
<i>Back then, do you have any idea
how much trouble that caused me?</i>

137
00:11:53,805 --> 00:11:57,038
Why? Did you take another woman there?

138
00:11:57,038 --> 00:12:00,005
<i>I'm filing for custody. Just so you know.</i>

139
00:12:00,872 --> 00:12:03,405
- Excuse...
- You're the one who abandoned Min Seo!

140
00:12:03,405 --> 00:12:06,605
How dare you talk about custody now?

141
00:12:06,605 --> 00:12:10,238
<i>Min Seo wants to live with me too.
Whatever. I'm hanging up.</i>

142
00:12:21,672 --> 00:12:24,238
What? What's wrong with this?

143
00:12:26,938 --> 00:12:28,838
What?

144
00:12:28,838 --> 00:12:32,205
What's wrong with this?

145
00:12:34,138 --> 00:12:35,172
Hello.

146
00:12:35,172 --> 00:12:38,605
What are you doing?
Were you eavesdropping on my call?

147
00:12:39,638 --> 00:12:41,138
Eavesdropping?

148
00:12:41,138 --> 00:12:43,872
I was here first, on my phone.

149
00:12:45,005 --> 00:12:47,472
